n option:\n* **Check city guidelines:** Some municipalities allow small deceased animals in standard household trash, while others prohibit it or require special collection.\n* If permitted, wrap the body securely in newspaper or cloth, place it inside a sealed plastic bag, and then put it inside another sturdy bag before placing it in the outdoor trash bin close to pickup day.\n\n### Temporary Storage\nIf you need time to decide or dig, place the hamster in a sealed box or airtight container and store it in a cool, dark place (like a garage). If it will be more than a few hours, placing the container in a refrigerator or freezer will preserve the body until you can proceed.",
